{
  "schema": "yoyo.swplan/1",
  "meta": {
    "name": "探针 建一半+镜像：板横跨对称面 → 3 个孔各自镜像 → 体积逐个递减",
    "units": "mm",
    "note": "验证「建一半 + 对称命令」这条策略能否对**多个特征**反复执行（箱座那类件要镜像的不止一个特征）。★★ 三个必须踩准的点：① 板必须**横跨对称面**（x∈[-30,30]，让 Right 面从中间切开）—— 板若整个在 +X 侧，镜像面只切到**边界** ⇒ 镜像结果与原件重合 ⇒ **8 种 API 组合全灭**且报错完全指不到根因（坑表 §100①）；② 用**中平面拉伸**（swEndCondMidPlane）让板对称；③ 判据用**体积**：每镜像一个孔，体积就少一个孔的量 （π·4²·10 = 502.7mm³）。`CreateMirrorFeature` 返回 Feature 对象、err=None、GetErrorCode=0 却什么都没建是本项目的经典坑（§96②）。"
  },
  "params": {},
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "n",
      "op": "new_part"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "op": "select_plane",
      "plane": "Front"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "op": "sketch_begin"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1",
      "op": "rect_corner",
      "x1": -30,
      "y1": -20,
      "x2": 30,
      "y2": 20,
      "note": "★★ 板必须**横跨 x=0**：Right 面（法向 X）正好从中间切开。"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "op": "sketch_end",
      "name": "PlateSk"
    },
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "op": "extrude_boss",
      "depth": 10,
      "end_cond": "swEndCondMidPlane",
      "name": "Plate",
      "note": "中平面拉伸 ⇒ 板关于 Front 面本身对称，镜像才有意义。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "op": "select_plane",
      "plane": "Front"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "op": "sketch_begin"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "op": "circle",
      "cx": 20,
      "cy": -15,
      "r": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "op": "circle",
      "cx": 20,
      "cy": -5,
      "r": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "op": "circle",
      "cx": 20,
      "cy": 5,
      "r": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "op": "sketch_end",
      "name": "HoleSk"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec",
      "op": "extrude_cut",
      "end_cond": "swEndCondThroughAllBoth",
      "both_directions": true,
      "name": "Hole1",
      "note": "一张草图 3 个圆 ⇒ 3 个孔在**同一个**特征里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb1",
      "op": "check_bbox",
      "expect": [
        60.0,
        40.0,
        10.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mr1",
      "op": "mirror",
      "target": "Hole1",
      "plane": "Right",
      "name": "Mirror1"
    },
    {
      "id": "v1",
      "op": "check_mass",
      "expect_volume_mm3": 20984.07,
      "vol_tol": 0.002,
      "note": "★★ 镜像后：多出 3 个对称孔 ⇒ 体积再少 3×502.65 = 20984.07 mm³。**体积不变 ⇒ 镜像没生效**（`CreateMirrorFeature` 返回 Feature 对象、err=None、GetErrorCode=0 却什么都没建，§96②）"
    },
    {
      "id": "mb2",
      "op": "check_mass",
      "expect_volume_mm3": 20984.07,
      "vol_tol": 0.002,
      "note": "终检：体积必须仍与 6 孔相符（改尺寸也会改体积，但改尺寸也会改 bbox ⇒ 两者一起看才够"
    },
    {
      "id": "diag",
      "op": "check_diagnostics",
      "fail_on": "error"
    },
    {
      "id": "sv",
      "op": "save_as",
      "path": "{{ params.out }}/probe_mirror_half.SLDPRT",
      "overwrite": true
    }
  ]
}
